A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1170784A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKIAGE NORIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKIAGE, NORIAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKIAGE NORIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKIAGE, NORIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A diffusion preventive film for preventing diffusion of Cu used as an interconnection material into an insulating film. The diffusion preventive film is of a crystalline WCN film. The WCN film has peaks of X-ray diffraction in a first position between 36 degrees and 38 degrees and in a second position between 42 degrees and 44 degrees. The half width of the peak in the first position is 3.2 degrees or less, and that in the second position is 2.6 degrees or less. The coverage of the WCN film is good, and therefore a thick barrier film can be formed in a recess having a high aspect ratio.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un film destiné à empêcher la diffusion de Cu utilisé en tant que matériau d'interconnexion dans une couche mince isolante. Ce film empêchant la diffusion est constitué d'un film cristallin de WCN, lequel présente des pics de diffraction dans une première position se situant entre 36 et 38 degrés et dans une seconde position se situant entre 42 et 44 degrés. La demi-largeur du pic dans la première position est de l'ordre de 3,2 degrés ou moins, et celle dans la seconde position est de l'ordre de 2,6 degrés ou moins. Le pouvoir couvrant de ce film de WCN est bon et il est donc possible de former un film épais dans un évidement possédant un facteur de forme élevé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>